{"3067650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiny Dino: Royale", "steam_appid": 3067650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "Tiny Dino: Royale is a genre bending clicker game where you will need to click to survive extinction in a constantly changing game.<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067650/extras/4ef1d180e33f805be2fa563119582730.poster.avif?t=1734328354\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067650/extras/4ef1d180e33f805be2fa563119582730.webm?t=1734328354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067650/extras/4ef1d180e33f805be2fa563119582730.mp4?t=1734328354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>COLLECTABLE DINOS! Collect unique dinos to play as and trade with others. Extra dinos can even be used to craft rare rewards.<br></li><li>ONLINE SURVIVAL! Compete with other players in seamless drop in and drop out multiplayer as you all fight to survive extinction.<br></li><li>CHAOTIC CLICKING! Keep clicking to survive but the rules will keep changing to keep you on your toes. One moment you may need to jump over asteroids while the next you may be blasting them out of the way with a Dino Gun™. But you'll need to be careful, take any damage and you'll have to start over completely.</li></ul> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067650/extras/339b694737a6ef02d9c480a506d857e3.poster.avif?t=1734328354\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067650/extras/339b694737a6ef02d9c480a506d857e3.webm?t=1734328354\" type=\"v